§ `The lives`

-- c051 (Chloe, 2028): the Byford house-and-land package, $620,000. Total value 620,000 is under the $800,000 cap (r 6, a
-- commencement date after 7 May 2026); a building contract is not an established home; the grant is the lesser of $10,000
-- and the consideration (s 19(2CA)) = $10,000. Both applicants meet every criterion.
#ASSERT `Is the grant payable to me` `c051: Chloe and Liam's Byford application`

#ASSERT `How much grant will I be paid` `c051: Chloe and Liam's Byford application` EQUALS 10000
#ASSERT `How much grant will I be paid` `c051 variant: Chloe and Liam, one contract for the package` EQUALS 10000

-- c051 and Duties Act consistency: Chloe and Liam are concessional first home owners (Duties Act s 142A(1)(a)).
#ASSERT `Am I a concessional first home owner for duty` `c051: Chloe and Liam's Byford application`

-- k074 (Jake, 2042): a single buyer at 35, off the plan, $390,000. Eligible transaction and $10,000, but s 8(1)(b)(ii): not
-- payable until the transaction is completed (settlement), unless the Commissioner pays early under s 18(2).
#ASSERT `Is my transaction eligible` `k074: Jake's apartment off the plan, before settlement`

#ASSERT `How much is my grant` `k074: Jake's apartment off the plan, before settlement` EQUALS 10000

#ASSERT NOT `Is the grant payable to me` `k074: Jake's application before settlement`
#ASSERT `Is the grant payable to me` `k074: Jake's application after settlement`

#ASSERT `Am I a concessional first home owner for duty` `k074: Jake's application before settlement`

§ `ss 9A, 10 and 7B -- age, citizenship, permanent residence`

#ASSERT NOT `Am I old enough` `a 17-year-old`
#ASSERT `Am I old enough` `a 17-year-old the Commissioner has exempted`

#ASSERT NOT `Do I meet the citizenship or residency criterion` `a temporary visa holder` `a temporary visa holder buying alone`
#ASSERT `Do I meet the citizenship or residency criterion` `a temporary visa holder` `a temporary visa holder buying with Jake`
#ASSERT NOT `Do I meet the citizenship or residency criterion` `a permanent visa holder who has not shown an intention to stay` `a temporary visa holder buying alone`

§ `ss 7, 11 and 12 -- no earlier grant, no earlier home`

#ASSERT NOT `Am I free of the second grant bar` `a buyer who has received a grant before`
#ASSERT `Am I free of the second grant bar` `a buyer who received a grant and paid it back under its conditions`

#ASSERT NOT `Have I never owned a home that counts` `a buyer who lived in a home of their own for 2 years`
#ASSERT `Have I never owned a home that counts` `a buyer who owned an investment flat but never lived in it`
#ASSERT NOT `Have I never owned a home that counts` `a buyer whose de facto partner of 3 years owned a home`
#ASSERT `Have I never owned a home that counts` `a buyer whose de facto partner of 1 year owned a home`
#ASSERT NOT `Have I never owned a home that counts` `a buyer whose husband owned a home`
#ASSERT `Have I never owned a home that counts` `a buyer separated for good from a husband who owned a home`

#ASSERT `Is this person my spouse or de facto partner` `a de facto partner of 3 years who owned a home`

§ `ss 13, 13A and 13B -- residence, convictions, trusts`

#ASSERT NOT `Do I meet the residence requirements` `a buyer who moves in 13 months after completion` `a 2027 buyer over the cap`
#ASSERT `Do I meet the residence requirements` `a buyer who moves in 13 months after completion with 18 months approved` `a 2027 buyer over the cap`
#ASSERT `Do I meet the residence requirements` `a co-buyer who never lives there, exempted` `Jake with a co-buyer who never lives there, exempted`
#ASSERT NOT `Do I meet the residence requirements` `a co-buyer who never lives there, exempted` `a lone co-buyer who never lives there, exempted`

#ASSERT `How many months must I live in the home` `Jake at 35` EQUALS 6

#ASSERT `Is the grant payable to me` `Jake with a co-buyer who never lives there, exempted`
#ASSERT NOT `Is the grant payable to me` `Jake leaving out a co-owner who must apply`

#ASSERT NOT `Am I eligible` `a buyer convicted under the Act` `a 2027 buyer over the cap`
#ASSERT NOT `Am I eligible` `a buyer holding as trustee` `a 2027 buyer over the cap`
#ASSERT `Am I eligible` `a buyer holding part as trustee under Help to Buy` `a 2027 buyer over the cap`

